Modified 2026-10-11 for iPad-Second-Screen. This patch is likewise GPL-3.0.

Keeps the connection up in clamshell: rotation builds the new display
before removing the old one, waits longer for it, retries failed rebuilds
on the same connection, and redials a device that is still reachable when
its session ends or fails to start.

